    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23347" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingĕnĭātus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingĕnŭāt-</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj.
		ingenium, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>naturally constituted</i>, <i>disposed</i> or <i>apt by nature</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lepide ingeniatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil. 3, 1, 136</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">primordia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 12, 1, 17</span></i>
			: ad astutiam, App. Flor. n. 18, p. 360, 20.</div>
